WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.767
Viewing notifications

00:00:05.817 --> 00:00:11.070
Open Notifications in the sidebar. New ones are listed under Today.

00:00:15.953 --> 00:00:20.986
Use the All Types list to see only one kind, for example Fee due.

00:00:23.277 --> 00:00:27.810
Switch back to All Types and tick Unread only to hide what you have read.

00:00:33.746 --> 00:00:37.630
Press Mark all read and confirm to clear everything at once.

00:00:43.386 --> 00:00:48.055
Inbox cleared
